            "action_name": {
              "value": "Breath Weapon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The copper dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Acid** (acid, arcane, evocation); The dragon breathes acid in a 60-foot line that deals 8d6 acid damage (26 basic Fortitude save).\n- **Slowing Gas** (arcane, transmutation); The dragon breathes a 60-foot line of slowing gas. Each creature in the area must succeed at a 26 Fortitude save or be slowed 1 for 1 round (or slowed 2 on a critical failure)."
            },
